{{!-- Share actions, in the two shapes the design draws them.

	{{> "post/share"}}              the row that closes the article: copy, email, Bluesky, X
	{{> "post/share" rail=true}}    the rail's pair: copy, email

The design draws three buttons and gives them nothing to do, and the row ships with a fourth. Here
each does the thing it is labelled with, because a button that looks live and is dead is worse
than no button:

  - Copy link asks the clipboard, and swaps its own label for a moment. It needs script, so it
	is the only one that is a <button> — and it carries `x-cloak`, so with scripting off it is
	not there at all rather than styled and dead, which is the same rule stated the other way
	round. `navigator.clipboard` is also unavailable over plain http on a non-localhost origin,
	and the catch in `postShare` is what keeps the label honest there. `aria-live` on the button
	is what carries the label change to a reader who cannot see it.
  - Email, Bluesky and X are links, because they are navigations. {{encode}} is Ghost's own URL
	encoder and {{url absolute="true"}} the canonical address of this post — a relative one
	would arrive in someone's inbox pointing at nothing. Bluesky's compose intent takes one
	`text`, so the address goes inside it; X's takes `text` and `url` separately, and passing the
	address as its own parameter is what makes the card unfurl.

Each control carries the mark of the thing it does, from `partials/share-icon.hbs`, and keeps its
word: an icon-only share row asks a reader to recognise four glyphs, and one of them is a chain
that means four different things across the web. `inline-flex` on every control is what the mark
costs in markup — a <button> and an <a> are inline boxes, so the mark would sit on the text
baseline and drag the line box around with it otherwise.

Both shapes carry their own button sizing rather than sharing a variable: the sizes are
literal in the source because the class scanner only ever sees what is written here. --}}
{{#if rail}}
	<div
		x-data="postShare('{{url absolute="true"}}')"
		class="pt-5">
		<p class="text-muted mb-3 font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">{{t "Share"}}</p>

		<div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
			<button
				type="button"
				x-cloak
				aria-live="polite"
				x-on:click="copy()"
				class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-3 py-2 text-[12.5px] font-semibold">
				{{> "share-icon" mark="link" size="size-[14px]"}}
				<span x-show="!copied">{{t "Copy link"}}</span>
				<span
					x-show="copied"
					x-cloak>{{t "Copied"}}</span>
			</button>

			<a
				href="mailto:?subject={{encode title}}&amp;body={{url absolute="true"}}"
				class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-3 py-2 text-[12.5px] font-semibold no-underline">{{> "share-icon" mark="mail" size="size-[14px]"}}<span>{{t "Email"}}</span></a>
		</div>
	</div>
{{else}}
	<div
		x-data="postShare('{{url absolute="true"}}')"
		class="border-border mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border-t pt-7">
		<span class="text-muted mr-1.5 font-mono text-[10.5px] tracking-[0.1em] uppercase">{{t "Share"}}</span>

		<button
			type="button"
			x-cloak
			aria-live="polite"
			x-on:click="copy()"
			class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-[15px] py-[9px] text-[13px] font-semibold">
			{{> "share-icon" mark="link"}}
			<span x-show="!copied">{{t "Copy link"}}</span>
			<span
				x-show="copied"
				x-cloak>{{t "Copied"}}</span>
		</button>

		<a
			href="mailto:?subject={{encode title}}&amp;body={{url absolute="true"}}"
			class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-[15px] py-[9px] text-[13px] font-semibold no-underline">{{> "share-icon" mark="mail"}}<span>{{t "Email"}}</span></a>

		<a
			href="https://bsky.app/intent/compose?text={{encode title}}%20{{url absolute="true"}}"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener"
			class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-[15px] py-[9px] text-[13px] font-semibold no-underline">{{> "share-icon" mark="bluesky"}}<span>{{t "Bluesky"}}</span></a>

		<a
			href="https://x.com/intent/post?text={{encode title}}&amp;url={{url absolute="true"}}"
			target="_blank"
			rel="noopener"
			class="btn border-border bg-surface font-ui text-text hover:bg-surface-2 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm border px-[15px] py-[9px] text-[13px] font-semibold no-underline">{{> "share-icon" mark="x"}}<span>{{t "X/Twitter"}}</span></a>
	</div>
{{/if}}
